Welcome to NeruOS Nebula VM Alpha

This is a temporary live environment for virtual-machine testing.
No disk installer is included. Changes disappear when the VM is powered off.

Shortcuts:
  Super + Enter   Open recovery terminal
  Alt + Tab       Switch application windows
  Alt + F4        Close the focused window
  Super + Q       Exit the NeruOS session

NeruOS Project: https://github.com/Nael12-kobo/NeruOS
